        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-3">
          
          <details class="group bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-900/60 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-4 transition-all [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-zinc-950 dark:text-white cursor-pointer select-none text-sm sm:text-base">
              <span>Apa itu pelatih aim FPS dan bagaimana cara meningkatkan akurasi mouse?</span>
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-zinc-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform duration-200 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5" /></svg>
            </summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800/80 pt-3">
              Pelatih aim FPS mengisolasi mekanik motorik membidik — akuisisi target (flicking), tracking, dan mikro-koreksi — dari variabel dalam game seperti recoil dan abilities. Ini memungkinkan ratusan repetisi per menit, mempercepat pembelajaran motorik serebelar dan mielinasi jalur saraf.
            </p>
          </details>

          <details class="group bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-900/60 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-4 transition-all [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-zinc-950 dark:text-white cursor-pointer select-none text-sm sm:text-base">
              <span>Apa itu eDPI dan bagaimana cara menghitungnya lintas game?</span>
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-zinc-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform duration-200 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5" /></svg>
            </summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800/80 pt-3">
              eDPI (effective Dots Per Inch) merepresentasikan sensitivitas sejati Anda: <code>eDPI = DPI × Sensitivitas Dalam Game</code>. Karena mesin game memakai konstanta yaw berbeda (CS2 memakai 0,022 vs Valorant 0,07), sensitivitas 1,0 di Valorant setara 3,1818 di CS2. Gunakan konverter sensitivitas bawaan untuk menjaga jarak rotasi 360 derajat identik di semua judul.
            </p>
          </details>

          <details class="group bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-900/60 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-4 transition-all [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-zinc-950 dark:text-white cursor-pointer select-none text-sm sm:text-base">
              <span>Haruskah membidik dengan lengan, pergelangan, atau ujung jari?</span>
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-zinc-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform duration-200 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5" /></svg>
            </summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800/80 pt-3">
              Atlet esports top memakai pendekatan hibrida: Aim lengan menangani sapuan lebar 90°–180° pada sensitivitas rendah, aim pergelangan menangani flick sedang dan tracking pada layar, dan mikro-adjusmen ujung jari menyempurnakan keselarasan headshot 5–15 piksel terakhir.
            </p>
          </details>

          <details class="group bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-900/60 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-4 transition-all [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-zinc-950 dark:text-white cursor-pointer select-none text-sm sm:text-base">
              <span>Apakah laju penyegaran monitor lebih tinggi (144Hz, 240Hz, 360Hz) meningkatkan aim?</span>
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-zinc-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform duration-200 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5" /></svg>
            </summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800/80 pt-3">
              Ya. Monitor 240Hz menurunkan latensi interval bingkai ke 4,16ms (dibanding 16,67ms pada 60Hz), drastis mengurangi motion blur dan ghosting sehingga sistem sakadik okular menghitung koordinat target dengan presisi lebih tinggi.
            </p>
          </details>

          <details class="group bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-900/60 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-4 transition-all [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-zinc-950 dark:text-white cursor-pointer select-none text-sm sm:text-base">
              <span>Berapa skor bagus pada Gridshot (Flicking)?</span>
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-zinc-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform duration-200 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5" /></svg>
            </summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800/80 pt-3">
              Dalam ronde 30 detik: 50k–70k poin (2,5–3,2 TPS dengan akurasi 85%+) merepresentasikan peringkat Gold/Platinum; 80k–95k merepresentasikan Master/Grandmaster; dan skor melebihi 100k poin (4,5+ TPS dengan akurasi 95%+) mencerminkan level esports profesional.
            </p>
          </details>

          <details class="group bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-900/60 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-4 transition-all [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-zinc-950 dark:text-white cursor-pointer select-none text-sm sm:text-base">
              <span>Bagaimana laju polling mouse (1000Hz vs 4000Hz vs 8000Hz) memengaruhi akurasi?</span>
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-zinc-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform duration-200 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5" /></svg>
            </summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800/80 pt-3">
              Polling 1000Hz memperbarui tiap 1,0ms. 4000Hz (0,25ms) dan 8000Hz (0,125ms) mengurangi latensi sensor-ke-CPU dan micro-stutter, menghasilkan kurva tracking lebih halus pada layar 240Hz+.
            </p>
          </details>

          <details class="group bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-900/60 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-4 transition-all [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-zinc-950 dark:text-white cursor-pointer select-none text-sm sm:text-base">
              <span>Mengapa akurasi lebih penting daripada kecepatan flick mentah saat latihan?</span>
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-zinc-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform duration-200 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5" /></svg>
            </summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800/80 pt-3">
              Gerakan cepat tak akurat memperkuat jalur motorik yang keliru dan memicu overshoot. Berlatih pada akurasi 90%–95% membangun lintasan kinematik bersih, memungkinkan kecepatan berkembang alami sebagai hasil samping efisiensi gerakan.
            </p>
          </details>

          <details class="group bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-900/60 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-4 transition-all [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-zinc-950 dark:text-white cursor-pointer select-none text-sm sm:text-base">
              <span>Apakah berat mouse dan friksi mousepad memengaruhi aim presisi?</span>
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-zinc-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform duration-200 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5" /></svg>
            </summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800/80 pt-3">
              Mouse ultraringan (sub-60g) meminimalkan inersia kinetik untuk daya henti seketika dan akselerasi flick awal lebih cepat. Mousepad friksi statis rendah memfasilitasi mikro-adjusmen tanpa usaha, sementara pad kain kontrol menawarkan daya henti untuk shooter taktis.
            </p>
          </details>

        </div>
      </section>

    </article>

